meta {
  name: Request Join Request Code
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/auth/email-code/join-request/request
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
}

body:json {
  "email": "applicant@example.com",
  "locale": "en"
}

docs {
  Step one of filing a join request (SEC-10). Public and unversioned: the
  email_code_requester cookie it sets is scoped to /auth. Emails a 6-digit
  code to the address (with EMAIL_CODE_DEV_LOG=true it is logged on one [dev]
  line). Every address gets the same answer: { challengeId, expiresAt,
  resendAvailableAt }. Copy challengeId into "Verify Join Request Code".
  403 JOIN_REQUESTS_CLOSED while requests are paused; 503
  email_code_unavailable while email codes are switched off.
}
